{"2026.5.8:P01-Q06":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铁硫氰还原维纶制备与银配位</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题6 · P01-Q06</div><h1>铁硫氰还原维纶制备与银配位</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：综合弱电解质拆写、有机缩合、少量多量反应和配合物形成。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/合成有机高分子化合物/合成有机高分子的基本方法</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/氧族元素及其化合物/二氧化硫</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>6. 下列方程式正确的是</p><p>A. 向红色<img src=\"chem-asset:364d560fcb478edf63c58e113807fffafff6c7c9c80b672ac71dc7a16c81f079:0;\" style=\"width:71.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中加入过量铁粉至溶液显浅绿色：<img src=\"chem-asset:5e7d4a04dee9c23af0d7a124db58145411b5a665d68035c12b92918493855d5b:1;\" style=\"width:121.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 制备维纶(聚乙烯醇缩甲醛纤维)：<img src=\"chem-asset:646681a7b034c85484e39905be727134fbf2df55a86c308856425c6b1f9517f7:2;\" style=\"width:444.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 向<img src=\"chem-asset:e254071171498e9ccd0f64de53cc34453d4009abeb34b601dd3334d956a986a0:3;\" style=\"width:61.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴加少量<img src=\"chem-asset:5d332085e9dc6a239cf8f70e5c2414386caf0dd202e5ca5c19773b5fc0d35e90:4;\" style=\"width:50.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液：<img src=\"chem-asset:af3379965a059a53e79f862e2695dc974bf07712eb0451036f809e46c90ba666:5;\" style=\"width:211.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:ad67c89e26d3424b533ec04cef6b1ec912c6213ad57d14f69b2cb30fd68ec79e:6;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀溶于氨水：<img src=\"chem-asset:4650d75fa081c0e0ee9086afb1234dfb8b487fdaa4cc975b699812f3d29964e5:7;\" style=\"width:236.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．向红色<img src=\"chem-asset:364d560fcb478edf63c58e113807fffafff6c7c9c80b672ac71dc7a16c81f079:0;\" style=\"width:71.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中加入过量铁粉至溶液显浅绿色，<img src=\"chem-asset:364d560fcb478edf63c58e113807fffafff6c7c9c80b672ac71dc7a16c81f079:0;\" style=\"width:71.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是弱电解质不能拆，故正确方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:16a4aa14b8f4bb2779914d76d61cfd8076a42b99d952999eabfc7010b2bf5d12:8;\" style=\"width:208.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A错误；</p><p>B．一个维纶的链节需要2个聚乙烯醇的链节和1分子甲醛发生缩合，脱去1分子水，所以反应的方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:722748fb7a559cf644a854bec86c39ce683e7cbcf03be4cb27f902a984093a65:9;\" style=\"width:432.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B错误；</p><p>C．向<img src=\"chem-asset:e254071171498e9ccd0f64de53cc34453d4009abeb34b601dd3334d956a986a0:3;\" style=\"width:61.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中滴加少量<img src=\"chem-asset:5d332085e9dc6a239cf8f70e5c2414386caf0dd202e5ca5c19773b5fc0d35e90:4;\" style=\"width:50.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，亚硫酸氢钠过量会放出<img src=\"chem-asset:8e8545a924bef272a7a6501251db651524b8ac36271a65e524b79ac375dd4622:10;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故正确的离子方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:f35f267f448cc46f2b9751c83ae4095a4fa0213912af3a7d1743f98c8c86b432:11;\" style=\"width:279.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，C错误；</p><p>D．<img src=\"chem-asset:ad67c89e26d3424b533ec04cef6b1ec912c6213ad57d14f69b2cb30fd68ec79e:6;\" style=\"width:40.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀溶于氨水：<img src=\"chem-asset:4650d75fa081c0e0ee9086afb1234dfb8b487fdaa4cc975b699812f3d29964e5:7;\" style=\"width:236.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["16a4aa14b8f4bb2779914d76d61cfd8076a42b99d952999eabfc7010b2bf5d12","364d560fcb478edf63c58e113807fffafff6c7c9c80b672ac71dc7a16c81f079","4650d75fa081c0e0ee9086afb1234dfb8b487fdaa4cc975b699812f3d29964e5","5d332085e9dc6a239cf8f70e5c2414386caf0dd202e5ca5c19773b5fc0d35e90","5e7d4a04dee9c23af0d7a124db58145411b5a665d68035c12b92918493855d5b","646681a7b034c85484e39905be727134fbf2df55a86c308856425c6b1f9517f7","722748fb7a559cf644a854bec86c39ce683e7cbcf03be4cb27f902a984093a65","8e8545a924bef272a7a6501251db651524b8ac36271a65e524b79ac375dd4622","ad67c89e26d3424b533ec04cef6b1ec912c6213ad57d14f69b2cb30fd68ec79e","af3379965a059a53e79f862e2695dc974bf07712eb0451036f809e46c90ba666","e254071171498e9ccd0f64de53cc34453d4009abeb34b601dd3334d956a986a0","f35f267f448cc46f2b9751c83ae4095a4fa0213912af3a7d1743f98c8c86b432"],"refs":{"chem-asset:364d560fcb478edf63c58e113807fffafff6c7c9c80b672ac71dc7a16c81f079:0;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/66a9d3420dfe793f97138e66.png","chem-asset:5e7d4a04dee9c23af0d7a124db58145411b5a665d68035c12b92918493855d5b:1;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/d557ef10b8471afd8178035d.png","chem-asset:646681a7b034c85484e39905be727134fbf2df55a86c308856425c6b1f9517f7:2;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/646681a7b034c85484e39905.png","chem-asset:e254071171498e9ccd0f64de53cc34453d4009abeb34b601dd3334d956a986a0:3;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3f230427d4b3826e169757fa.png","chem-asset:5d332085e9dc6a239cf8f70e5c2414386caf0dd202e5ca5c19773b5fc0d35e90:4;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/e08a0667a5ca921509f51eef.png","chem-asset:af3379965a059a53e79f862e2695dc974bf07712eb0451036f809e46c90ba666:5;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/93fb5a265165c7e56bb44974.png","chem-asset:ad67c89e26d3424b533ec04cef6b1ec912c6213ad57d14f69b2cb30fd68ec79e:6;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/579e318b05d027191d9972d3.png","chem-asset:4650d75fa081c0e0ee9086afb1234dfb8b487fdaa4cc975b699812f3d29964e5:7;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a7532225f510eaf99a13c3b8.png","chem-asset:16a4aa14b8f4bb2779914d76d61cfd8076a42b99d952999eabfc7010b2bf5d12:8;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/590f2c0b0c59abf9da032461.png","chem-asset:722748fb7a559cf644a854bec86c39ce683e7cbcf03be4cb27f902a984093a65:9;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/722748fb7a559cf644a854be.png","chem-asset:8e8545a924bef272a7a6501251db651524b8ac36271a65e524b79ac375dd4622:10;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/0103d48a7d6cf3a10b029e1c.png","chem-asset:f35f267f448cc46f2b9751c83ae4095a4fa0213912af3a7d1743f98c8c86b432:11;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/3e76afef27e99e3cdde84324.png"},"sourceSha256":"eb0563f77839be5ebf9afe0767c9eca91407a2c56035f7ae61b82a6eba9efa80","bom":false,"legacyPath":"认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写/2026.5.8/P01-Q06_铁硫氰还原维纶制备与银配位.html"},"2026.5.8:P01-Q07":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>肉桂酸龙脑酯的药物组装</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题7 · P01-Q07</div><h1>肉桂酸龙脑酯的药物组装</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的分类/有机官能团的性质及结构</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：分析催化还原计量、手性碳及酯类除杂和选择氧化。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的结构特点</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机反应类型</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/醛类</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/醇类</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/酯</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/认识有机物/研究有机化合物的一般步骤和方法/有机物的分离与提纯</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>7. 科学家对具有生物活性的中药提取物肉桂醛和龙脑进行结构组装，合成新型药物肉桂酸龙脑酯，下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:1e6a73cbe4ec65b86b959643ae7fa812c0ac4be9122a80a28016eb18d8321ad4:0;\" style=\"width:550.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. 肉桂醛最多能被<img src=\"chem-asset:52799326182b0a9d12afea6921cc8034b248e09308713057b5e78098de9235d2:1;\" style=\"width:60.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">催化还原</p><p>B. 1个龙脑分子中含有3个手性碳原子</p><p>C. 可用氢氧化钠溶液除去肉桂酸龙脑酯中的肉桂酸杂质</p><p>D. 碱性<img src=\"chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:2;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液用酸性<img src=\"chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:2;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液代替更好，还可省去步骤I中的反应②</p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】B</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．肉桂醛中苯环、碳碳双键、醛基均能与氢气发生加成反应，1 mol肉桂醛最多能与5 mol <img src=\"chem-asset:826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32:3;\" style=\"width:23.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">发生催化还原反应，选项未明确肉桂醛的物质的量，故A错误；</p><p>B．手性碳原子是指连有四个不同基团的碳原子，由龙脑的结构可知，1个龙脑分子中含有3个手性碳原子，故B正确；</p><p>C．肉桂酸龙脑酯含有酯基，在氢氧化钠溶液中会发生水解反应，所以不能用氢氧化钠溶液除去肉桂酸龙脑酯中的肉桂酸杂质，故C错误；</p><p>D．酸性<img src=\"chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液会将肉桂醛中的碳碳双键氧化，不能用酸性<img src=\"chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液代替碱性<img src=\"chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液，故D错误；</p><p>故选B。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["1e6a73cbe4ec65b86b959643ae7fa812c0ac4be9122a80a28016eb18d8321ad4","52799326182b0a9d12afea6921cc8034b248e09308713057b5e78098de9235d2","826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32","86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5","f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659"],"refs":{"chem-asset:1e6a73cbe4ec65b86b959643ae7fa812c0ac4be9122a80a28016eb18d8321ad4:0;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1e6a73cbe4ec65b86b959643.png","chem-asset:52799326182b0a9d12afea6921cc8034b248e09308713057b5e78098de9235d2:1;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a73a010ae8cbc14596a96ec6.png","chem-asset:86335640b6abab245117a7a7052eb7909ed5f9fb35eb620c39eda25991166cd5:2;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/1137bc2af6ba2d0b0c6016e5.png","chem-asset:826df31e191fd74de775e57ce0bd0eadff4459f5015c97d2b982206a873c9c32:3;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/eaf1cf103c1bdcd3e81eb680.png","chem-asset:f3593e8dce53ed4f9275267ffee2246c4453c0c644c07db535d89838a94b1659:4;":"../../../../../%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90/a21185ef290d6804e91dea44.png"},"sourceSha256":"2f373ddb3695321d3dc5d11684c2eb854e90d41944c899d4effd56908ea10579","bom":false,"legacyPath":"有机化学基础/认识有机物/有机物的分类/有机官能团的性质及结构/2026.5.8/P01-Q07_肉桂酸龙脑酯的药物组装.html"},"2026.5.8:P02-Q05":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铜硫化氢氮氧化物与银镜方程式</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 麓山国际四月学情调研 · 原题5 · P02-Q05</div><h1>铜硫化氢氮氧化物与银镜方程式</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：根据弱电解质拆写、少量试剂和氧化还原配平判断离子式。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应的应用/氧化还原反应方程式的书写与配平</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/沉淀溶解平衡的应用</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/氮族元素及其化合物/氮的氧化物</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/醛类</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：<img src=\"chem-asset:bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742:0;\" style=\"width:434.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>5. 下列离子方程式书写正确的是</p><p>A. 向氯化铜溶液中通入硫化氢：<img src=\"chem-asset:5e8eea72a26441653de61f470829402b566c519594a53827cf766870f0e4fc16:1;\" style=\"width:127.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 向<img src=\"chem-asset:5bd2745cf23414f8a6220a41d33fff5558f7f6547295f921a2963418765a5090:2;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中加少量<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:3;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液：<img src=\"chem-asset:94f27d6afa525ec9516e961b6aedf060db34dfd2f5ca1635f32d7ca20badab0d:4;\" style=\"width:327.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 用氢氧化钠溶液吸收工业废气中的<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:5;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：<img src=\"chem-asset:028e9aa0483ab4894296bbd701eb9dd7093a6274759bbb72da975689f1be68e9:6;\" style=\"width:224.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 乙二醛与银氨溶液反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:c8e3442ee6359c9a49cafbcff241fe346ba4eba345d663454c9ea862c57c2842:7;\" style=\"width:388.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:334d716e5613aee024620876f0176c53fd2710f96ed81f1dd1970f7f85dfde07:8;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．向氯化铜溶液中通入硫化氢，硫化氢是弱酸，离子方程式应为：<img src=\"chem-asset:cc551d2f1eff41d2481f7ffaac083a80eab6c9226847d07247d461e68ea43c5f:9;\" style=\"width:89.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:875c8ed7b54a1f8b21b2e18f297380ccfe6b52a8d0ab184d170a1093cd9b0f02:10;\" style=\"width:83.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故A错误；</p><p>B．向<img src=\"chem-asset:5bd2745cf23414f8a6220a41d33fff5558f7f6547295f921a2963418765a5090:2;\" style=\"width:63.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液中加入少量<img src=\"chem-asset:4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040:3;\" style=\"width:63.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">反应生成碳酸钙和氢氧化钠，反应离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:c714ed120207f0245f1616f60a1e5d9f7168c109867a2347667ad681ed634e91:11;\" style=\"width:149.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:ccb3270792c0d46af45afe0827fc517e562ea3a0a34f8920b81f5643dc3520b2:12;\" style=\"width:107.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故B错误；</p><p>C．用氢氧化钠溶液吸收工业废气中的<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:5;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a:5;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和NaOH溶液反应生成硝酸钠、亚硝酸钠和水，离子方程式为：<img src=\"chem-asset:028e9aa0483ab4894296bbd701eb9dd7093a6274759bbb72da975689f1be68e9:6;\" style=\"width:224.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故C正确；</p><p>D．乙二醛与银氨溶液反应生成乙二酸铵、银、氨气、水，反应的离子方程式为<img src=\"chem-asset:06ce6a233b75bfb9daed907ea2170e5e955a4a18d737d022e2edacc9330b0405:13;\" style=\"width:269.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:2dbf2b0ad7f5cd8570ae606a00de44f95f41cf628746d847b94d668b2955f17d:14;\" style=\"width:57.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"chem-asset:fe72b3e1df4135600bea593a18e520c6de2b1a1764bca371232ecb7f1e994af0:15;\" style=\"width:195.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故D错误；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷\\精品解析：湖南长沙麓山国际实验学校2026届下学期高三4月学情检测 化学试卷（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E9%BA%93%E5%B1%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A12026%E5%B1%8A%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%894%E6%9C%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%83%85%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["028e9aa0483ab4894296bbd701eb9dd7093a6274759bbb72da975689f1be68e9","06ce6a233b75bfb9daed907ea2170e5e955a4a18d737d022e2edacc9330b0405","2dbf2b0ad7f5cd8570ae606a00de44f95f41cf628746d847b94d668b2955f17d","334d716e5613aee024620876f0176c53fd2710f96ed81f1dd1970f7f85dfde07","4734ee430120c562e9e595c9a1d65318ea065f711eb109e6b16e9a349f2a5040","5bd2745cf23414f8a6220a41d33fff5558f7f6547295f921a2963418765a5090","5e8eea72a26441653de61f470829402b566c519594a53827cf766870f0e4fc16","7ad0a81bdb8fc74f1e60342b1b287aaecc08d25cd5c5ae03560f42de0092f99a","875c8ed7b54a1f8b21b2e18f297380ccfe6b52a8d0ab184d170a1093cd9b0f02","94f27d6afa525ec9516e961b6aedf060db34dfd2f5ca1635f32d7ca20badab0d","bc0294b7930761d09bc9a04f693fad604dd3312150b6b8d5f47faef0bd351742","c714ed120207f0245f1616f60a1e5d9f7168c109867a2347667ad681ed634e91","c8e3442ee6359c9a49cafbcff241fe346ba4eba345d663454c9ea862c57c2842","cc551d2f1eff41d2481f7ffaac083a80eab6c9226847d07247d46